]]></description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:19:56 +0000</pubDate><link>https://github.com/diggerhq/opencomputer</link><dc:creator>iacguy</dc:creator><comments>https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50581403</comments><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50581403</guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Inkling 2 Mini]]></title><description><![CDATA[
